# Normalize text files to LF in the repository. Line-ending-sensitive files
# (shell scripts, Python entry points, Makefiles) must never be checked out
# with CRLF: bash and GNU make reject \r in shebangs, commands, and recipes.
# Compiled C# is pinned too: .editorconfig sets end_of_line=lf and the build
# enforces it (EnforceCodeStyleInBuild + TreatWarningsAsErrors), so an
# autocrlf checkout would fail the compile with IDE0055 formatting errors.
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.cs text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
